arguments.prompt:
You are implementing a Blazor shipment tracking app in /tmp/sv-a607bdd73b3c44e3ba2f255b896c876a/ShipmentTracker. The project uses Interactive Auto Global mode with Individual auth. It has two projects: ShipmentTracker (server) and ShipmentTracker.Client (WebAssembly).

## Architecture Rules
- Interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Components in `.Client` cannot access DbContext directly — they must use HTTP APIs
- Define service interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient in `.Client` and with direct DB access in server
- Both Program.cs files must register matching services
- No need for `@rendermode` on pages (global mode)

## What to implement

### 1. Shared Models (in Client project since both sides need them)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/ShipmentModels.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class ShipmentSummary
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Exception
}
```

### 2. Service Interface (Client project)

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<ShipmentSummary>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<ShipmentSummary?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus);
}
```

### 3. Client-side HTTP implementation

Create `ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentHttpService.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentHttpService(HttpClient http) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<ShipmentSummary>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<ShipmentSummary>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentSummary?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<ShipmentSummary?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        await http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", newStatus);
    }
}
```

### 4. Update Client Program.cs

Edit `ShipmentTracker.Client/Program.cs` to register the HttpClient and ShipmentHttpService:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

var builder = WebAssemblyHostBuilder.CreateDefault(args);

builder.Services.AddAuthorizationCore();
builder.Services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();
builder.Services.AddAuthenticationStateDeserialization();

builder.Services.AddHttpClient("ShipmentTracker.ServerAPI", client =>
    client.BaseAddress = new Uri(builder.HostEnvironment.BaseAddress));
builder.Services.AddScoped(sp => sp.GetRequiredService<IHttpClientFactory>().CreateClient("ShipmentTracker.ServerAPI"));
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentHttpService>();

await builder.Build().RunAsync();
```

### 5. Server-side Entity and DbContext update

Create `ShipmentTracker/Data/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; } = DateTime.UtcNow;
}
```

Edit `ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add:
```csharp
public DbSet<Shipment> Shipments => Set<Shipment>();
```

Make sure to add the using for `ShipmentTracker.Data` if not already present. The existing file likely looks like:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity.EntityFrameworkCore;
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ApplicationDbContext(DbContextOptions<ApplicationDbContext> options) : IdentityDbContext<ApplicationUser>(options)
{
}
```

Add the DbSet property to it.

### 6. Server-side service implementation

Create `ShipmentTracker/Services/ShipmentServerService.cs`:
```csharp
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

public class ShipmentServerService(IServiceProvider serviceProvider) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<ShipmentSummary>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        return await db.Shipments.Select(s => new ShipmentSummary
        {
            Id = s.Id,
            TrackingNumber = s.TrackingNumber,
            Origin = s.Origin,
            Destination = s.Destination,
            Status = s.Status,
            EstimatedDelivery = s.EstimatedDelivery,
            CustomerEmail = s.CustomerEmail
        }).ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<ShipmentSummary?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        var s = await db.Shipments.FirstOrDefaultAsync(x => x.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
        if (s is null) return null;
        return new ShipmentSummary
        {
            Id = s.Id,
            TrackingNumber = s.TrackingNumber,
            Origin = s.Origin,
            Destination = s.Destination,
            Status = s.Status,
            EstimatedDelivery = s.EstimatedDelivery,
            CustomerEmail = s.CustomerEmail
        };
    }

    public async Task UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        using var scope = serviceProvider.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<ApplicationDbContext>();
        var shipment = await db.Shipments.FindAsync(id);
        if (shipment is not null)
        {
            shipment.Status = newStatus;
            await db.SaveChangesAsync();
        }
    }
}
```

### 7. API Endpoints

Create `ShipmentTracker/Endpoints/ShipmentEndpoints.cs`:
```csharp
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;

public static class ShipmentEndpoints
{
    public static void MapShipmentEndpoints(this WebApplication app)
    {
        var group = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

        group.MapGet("/", async (ApplicationDbContext db) =>
        {
            return await db.Shipments.Select(s => new ShipmentSummary
            {
                Id = s.Id,
                TrackingNumber = s.TrackingNumber,
                Origin = s.Origin,
                Destination = s.Destination,
                Status = s.Status,
                EstimatedDelivery = s.EstimatedDelivery,
                CustomerEmail = s.CustomerEmail
            }).ToListAsync();
        });

        group.MapGet("/track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, ApplicationDbContext db) =>
        {
            var s = await db.Shipments.FirstOrDefaultAsync(x => x.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
            if (s is null) return Results.NotFound();
            return Results.Ok(new ShipmentSummary
            {
                Id = s.Id,
                TrackingNumber = s.TrackingNumber,
                Origin = s.Origin,
                Destination = s.Destination,
                Status = s.Status,
                EstimatedDelivery = s.EstimatedDelivery,
                CustomerEmail = s.CustomerEmail
            });
        });

        group.MapPut("/{id}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus, ApplicationDbContext db) =>
        {
            var shipment = await db.Shipments.FindAsync(id);
            if (shipment is null) return Results.NotFound();
            shipment.Status = newStatus;
            await db.SaveChangesAsync();
            return Results.NoContent();
        });
    }
}
```

### 8. Update Server Program.cs

Edit `ShipmentTracker/Program.cs`. Add these registrations AFTER the existing service registrations (after `AddSingleton<IEmailSender...>` line) and BEFORE `var app = builder.Build();`:
```csharp
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentServerService>();
```

Add the endpoint mapping AFTER `app.MapAdditionalIdentityEndpoints();` and BEFORE `app.Run();`:
```csharp
app.MapShipmentEndpoints();
```

Add these usings at the top of the file:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;
```

### 9. Pages in Client project

Delete the existing Counter.razor and Weather.razor from `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/`.

Replace `ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Home.razor` with:
```razor
@page "/"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>ShipmentTracker - Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Shipment Tracker</h1>
<p>Welcome to the logistics shipment tracking system.</p>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title">Dispatcher Dashboard</h5>
                <p class="card-text">View and manage all shipments, update statuses.</p>
                <a href="/dispatcher" class="btn btn-primary">Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
